<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech OKD 9mo pre-tax profit CZK 46.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Czech OKD 9mo pre-tax profit CZK 46.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine months ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	     46.116   vs    n/a</p>
<p> Operating profit	   93.936   vs    n/a</p>
<p> Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services	   17,616.933   vs    n/a</p>
<p> Total assets	   45,022.386   vs    n/a</p>
<p> Basic capital	  27,800.000   vs    n/a</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is OKD a.s.. It is the largest Czech coal mining firm. The company did not give comparatives. OKD shares are traded on the free market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
